# ::tok In the breach letter, which the Privacy Authority sent to the company, the Authority emphasized that most companies and large organizations in the economy are required to adopt a dynamic information security policy, and that as threats and risks evolve, the organization has an obligation to carefully consider the updated risks and act according to the updated security measures accepted in the circumstances, depending on the nature and quality of the database.
